Z||000000||1FST2M6||04-18-2001||08:23 AM||||It's sunny and 63* i've got the roof off the windows down on my way home from work yesterday. well as you know i've got a shop sticker on the back-window of my cheeto. well as i merge on to a local 4 lane hwy just 5min from my house i notice a guy in a Black C5 behind me... so as the car shifts i goose it and chirp 2nd JUST as it slams into gear this not so bright guy ROMPS on his car and is on my A$$. theres no traffic and he pulls up next to me and drops it into 2nd and LIGHTS up his meats. seeing the lack of traction opportunity i too get into it and pull away from him i'm a FULL car length ahead of him and he still thinking he's cool powering sidways down the road as he backs off and we got stuck at a traffic a light... my cell phone rings. it's Red Neck John from the shop.. LAUGHING his A$$ off.. "..theres some guy on line one wonderin what the hell I'm driving..." ---actuall words ring~ Engineered Performance...  /uum what the hell are you trying to prove- /(steve) uum nothing dude- /you must not realize what your up aginst- /(steve) uum i must not.. who is this... CLICk... and the guy hangs up.. well with modern technology Caller ID has his cell phone number so steve calls him back. (Steve)hey this is steve from engineered performance.. you just called here.. where are you and what do you drive?- /(vette) i'm on HWY41 following an Orange Fiero in my 2001 Black Corvette, where are you- /(lots of laughing on the shop sides of the phones by this time all 4 phones are picked up and RNJ talking to me on line 2) (steve) I'm at a shop that made that car faster than your $40,000 toy... if you think you can hold a candle to that car come down here this weekend and we'll see what we can arrange.. we've got a chassis dyno and a clue.. whats your story.. (vette) WHAT you've got a chassis dyno.. where are you guys.. is there a turbo kit for my car? (steve) i'm not sure about that but i know theres a S/C kit for it.. (vette) i'll see ya in the morning  ((click)) <BR>well it's 8:30 and I'll let ya know when the C5 owner shows up at the shop..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <P>HEHEHEHEHHEHE... his lack of traction and my seeing the window to pseudo-spank a shiney new Corvette just made the shop a few bucks! heheheh damage a vette owners pride and watch em squirm.<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig1fst.jpg">      <BR>www.engineered.net<BR>www.epdyno.com<BR>www.enthuzacar.com||||reg||1
