Z||000003||Alex4mula||04-18-2001||08:45 AM||||Was the road wet? Were his rear tires groveless? If he had the switch off he could easily loose traction in poor road conditions (or worn tires). It happened to me at 50MPH and was very scary.  Even with the switch on you can loose traction and the system will slow you down until control is regained. The poor guy doesn't know how to drive it. Anyway, I still like seeing a Fiero spanking one of those  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||1
